  "limitations": [],
  "deviations": [
    "The master key and join tokens are streamed node-to-node through the operator workstation (ssh node-01 ... | ssh node-0N ...) instead of from node-01 over SSH; the bytes never touch the workstation's disk, as in the docs.",
    "apt-get gets -o DPkg::Lock::Timeout=300 because a fresh cloud image runs unattended-upgrades at first boot.",
    "The [testing] section that \u00a78.3 adds later (with a restart) is written at creation, so fault scenarios need no rolling restart.",
    "buildah (optional in \u00a71) is installed on node-01 only.",
    "Cluster name is `rbeval`, not `prod`; addresses are the lab's 10.77.0.0/24.",
    "Operator CIDR is the hypervisor bridge address 10.77.0.1/32, where the harness runs.",
    "operator_cidrs goes in every node's config, not only Node 1's as \u00a73.2 shows. With Node 1 alone the workstation reaches no other node's API, so relish cannot fail over and the survivors of a Node 1 failure cannot be observed from outside."
  ],
